// Application-level settings for the Runner target.
//
// This may be replaced with something auto-generated from metadata (e.g., pubspec.yaml) in the
// future. If not, the values below would default to using the project name when this becomes a
// 'flutter create' template.

// The application's name. By default this is also the title of the Flutter window.
//
// Capitalised as the product is written everywhere else. It was `ocideck`, which
// is why the macOS application menu read "About ocideck" and "Quit ocideck"
// while the rest of the menu bar was properly cased (#646).
PRODUCT_NAME = OciDeck

// The application's bundle identifier.
//
// Deliberately NOT renamed to the foundation's domain. A bundle identifier is
// the app's identity to the operating system: change it and macOS treats this
// as a different application — separate preferences, and separate keychain
// entries, so every stored password would look gone. That is a migration, not
// a tidy-up. The copyright below is what people actually read.
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.dewinter.ocideck

// The copyright displayed in application information
// Shown in the macOS "About" panel. The publisher is the foundation, not a
// company — corrected 2026-07-22 (#646); see COMPLIANCE.md for who holds what.
PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT = Copyright © 2026 Stichting LibreKAT. Licensed under the EUPL-1.2.
